    "text": "Putin JOINS Trump in BIG ATTACK ON Denmark, NATO Over Greenland - SLAMS Denmark’s ‘HARSH’ RuleRussia’s President Vladimir Putin appears to align with Donald Trump in a stunning attack on Denmark and NATO over the Greenland controversy. In a rare and provocative intervention, Putin accuses Denmark of treating Greenland like a colony, calling Copenhagen’s rule “harsh” while distancing Moscow from the dispute. Drawing a direct comparison to the U.S. acquisition of Alaska, Putin argues that Greenland’s future is not Russia’s business and insists Washington can easily handle any financial cost involved. #GreenlandDenmark #TrumpGreenland #PutinTrumpGreenland #TrumpPutin #DenmarkGreenland #GreenlandDispute #TrumpDemand #PutinBacksTrump #TrumpGreenlandPlans #ArcticPolitics #NATOCrisis #DenmarkRejectsTrump #GreenlandCrisis #TrumpEnvoy #TruthSocial #TrumpComments #USDenmark #PutinOnGreenland #TrumpInterest #GreenlandTroops #EuropeTensions #GlobalGeopolitics #BreakingNews #WorldPolitics #PowerPolitics #oneindianews #oneindiaenglish #breakingnews #worldnews #englishnewslive #englishnews #latestnews #news",
